%%{init: {'theme':'default', 'flowchart': {'nodeSpacing': 35, 'rankSpacing': 28}}}%%
flowchart TD
    Start([Customer called CSP earlier · CSP missed it]) --> PN[CSP gets missed-call alert on CSP App]
    PN --> Open[CSP taps the alert or opens call log<br/>Dials the Wiom IVR Masked number]
    Open --> Recognise[IVR recognises the CSP and finds 1 active ticket for them]
    Recognise --> Bridge[Bridges to the customer · No PIN needed]
    Bridge --> Pick{Customer picks up?}
    Pick -->|Yes| Connect[Both parties talk · Call recorded]
    Pick -->|No| Missed[CSP hears 'call not picked']

    classDef start fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4338ca,color:#312e81
    classDef good fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef neutral fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    class Start start
    class Connect good
    class PN,Missed neutral
